  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component C World Economic Forum.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will seek to support developing countries and communities access climate finance for blue carbon, particularly through voluntary carbon markets. It will support evidence generation and knowledge transfer for countries, communities, and project developers to set up successful blue carbon projects, help improve the standards used to monitor and verify blue carbon projects and improve the international coordination and coherence across blue carbon initiatives. Through strengthening the pipeline of bankable projects and improving regulatory frameworks, the component will aim to unlock private finance as a key aim towards blue carbon habitat conservation, sustainable management, and restoration.</narrative>
  </description>
